<p>Thanks for the criticism, I appreciate it.</p>
<p>Unfortunately due to the fact there is a 400 word limit from what I’ve been told and read for these posts I can’t put alot of details in without going over the limit so I’ll answer your questions here! So in Order:</p>
<ul>
<li>I was thinking a possible minor memetic ability it has causes the host prey have false memories of getting the tattoo in order to lull the prey host into a false belief.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>Basically what i mean is that more tattoos would appear on the prey hosts body taking the form of claw/bite marks like one would see on a carcass after a animal chews and claws at it.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>On the outside the victim looks completely fine with no physical wounds anywhere on the body save for the tatto markings. Autopsy however would show that random organs/muscle tissue seemed to have mysteriously vanished with no answers as to how and what caused it. This is what also caught the attention of the foundation.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>The Tattoo appears randomly, ranging from a few minutes to days before its next manifestation as well as its victims being random as well with no pattern being apparent.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>i have the scp set up in a way it favors more exotic predators such as extinct ones as a means of attracting more prey since the more intricate a tattoo the more it would attract tattoo enthusiasts.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>Basically its hunting style would be similar to species that try to disorient/separate prey in an attempt to get the host to leave the sight of anyone around them so it can strike.</li>
</ul>
<p>I made an attempt to add more detail to the actual article so i hope it as well as my answers help in painting a picture of this scp</p>

